Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.42,0:49:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不跑，我就舔你。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.99,0:49:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.99,0:49:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的不喜歡它。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.99,0:49:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.99,0:49:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,別說了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.99,0:49:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,別說了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.63,0:49:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,請停止吧。
